{
    "title": "KeyConnect Digital Car Key",
    "description": "Thanks to new-cutting edge technology, KeyConnect enhances smart control and safety of your cars.\r\n\r\nBest rated universal car remote control app on iPhone is now available on Google Play. KeyConnect is the 1st carplay app to MANAGE MULTIPLE car keys in single phone.\r\n\r\nFeatures that matter:\r\n\r\n> WIRELESSLY LOCK & UNLOCK car door from home, office, or anywhere without delay. No hardware required. You don't even need to come close your cars. Remote lock & unlock will save your day if you lose car key or lock car key inside car.\r\n\r\n> Ensure drive safety before departure. Remote CHECK LIVE vehicle engine status including tire pressure, oil / EV battery level, and receive safety alerts to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.\r\n\r\n> Share car key securely with BANK-GRADE SECURITY protocol. Share car key digitally with car renters without physical keyfob exchange or with other family members in need.\r\n\r\n> SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your car or find fastest routes to car parks or gas / EV charging stations on maps.\r\n\r\n> KeyConnect supports 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.\r\n\r\nWe're working with car manufacturers to support more car makes and improve overal carplay keyless experience.\r\n\r\nWe currently offer the following auto-renewing subscription options for the Premium version:\r\n- $19.99/month\r\n- $69.99/year\r\n\r\nKeyConnect helps connect & control your cars. Remote Lock and unlock car, carplay and much more.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about Keyconnect, please visit http://www.keyconnectapp.com/\r\nCustomer service: info@apponfire.co",
    "descriptionHTML": "Thanks to new-cutting edge technology, KeyConnect enhances smart control and safety of your cars.<br><br>Best rated universal car remote control app on iPhone is now available on Google Play. KeyConnect is the 1st carplay app to MANAGE MULTIPLE car keys in single phone.<br><br>Features that matter:<br><br>&gt; WIRELESSLY LOCK &amp; UNLOCK car door from home, office, or anywhere without delay. No hardware required. You don&#39;t even need to come close your cars. Remote lock &amp; unlock will save your day if you lose car key or lock car key inside car.<br><br>&gt; Ensure drive safety before departure. Remote CHECK LIVE vehicle engine status including tire pressure, oil / EV battery level, and receive safety alerts to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.<br><br>&gt; Share car key securely with BANK-GRADE SECURITY protocol. Share car key digitally with car renters without physical keyfob exchange or with other family members in need.<br><br>&gt; SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your car or find fastest routes to car parks or gas / EV charging stations on maps.<br><br>&gt; KeyConnect supports 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.<br><br>We&#39;re working with car manufacturers to support more car makes and improve overal carplay keyless experience.<br><br>We currently offer the following auto-renewing subscription options for the Premium version:<br>- $19.99/month<br>- $69.99/year<br><br>KeyConnect helps connect &amp; control your cars. Remote Lock and unlock car, carplay and much more.<br><br>To learn more about Keyconnect, please visit http://www.keyconnectapp.com/<br>Customer service: info@apponfire.co",
